// in Boltz's atom order (const.ref_atoms; UNK = N CA C O CB), coordinates in angstrom rounded to 6 decimals.
// Boltz's featuriser draws one conformer per residue at random (`random.choice(conf_ids)`) before centring and
// rotating it; featurise.js draws uniformly with a seeded generator.
